---
title: States of the relying party (Satoshi)
---

stateDiagram-v2
    state "No trusted key" as Unknown
    state "Resolve the DID" as Resolving
    state "Trusted: version N" as Trusted
    state "Rejected" as Rejected
    state "Closed: DID deactivated" as Closed

    [*] --> Unknown
    Unknown --> Resolving: first contact
    Trusted --> Resolving: message with an unknown key
    Resolving --> Trusted: key in the DID document
    Resolving --> Resolving: data missing, ask Stuart
    Resolving --> Rejected: invalid DID or key
    Rejected --> Trusted: keep the last trusted keys
    Resolving --> Closed: deactivated
    Closed --> [*]
